<title>INDIA: India's Wockhardt board meet postponed.</title>
<headline>India's Wockhardt board meet postponed.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian pharmaceuticals firm Wockhardt said on Monday it had postponed its board meeting to approve results.</p>
<p>The meeting -- which was originally scheduled for September 29 -- will be held on October 2 in Bombay, a company official said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
